<title>USA: Unisys to take $0.07 a shr charge in Q4.</title>
<headline>Unisys to take $0.07 a shr charge in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Wednesday that its fourth quarter 1996 results will include an extraordinary charge of about $0.07 a share for the early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>The company said that it has completed its previously announced plan to retire debt securities with near-term maturities using the proceeds of the $450 million of new notes due 2004 issued in October 1996.</p>
</text>
